{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"想到这个格外想亲近的人，他心里就柔软起来，也早已想清楚要向对方说什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"格外想亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"真要说破时，他怕这会改变两人的关系，舍不得放下这点喜欢，便把它留在心里。\",\n      \"key\": \"改变两人的关系\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留想到特定对象时的柔软，并补出他清楚想表达什么，让B2中的明确意图落到人物心里，不把开口前的谨慎写成不知道自己想要什么。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\", \"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把想说又收住的牵制合为一条，用怕说破会改变关系解释迟疑，替换R3中说不清缘由的判断。R3中暂不安排喜欢的去向，是应对选择而非谨慎的原因，留给后续R5承接。R4的舍不得并入此条；删去轻得仿佛随时可以放下的说法，因为它没有独立的后续作用，也不能解释为何迟疑。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "31c55d6e-15e3-416f-9be5-783207a10977", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T044701937538Z", "elapsed_seconds": 325.438, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T04:52:27.389234+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "595e8e5f59ddc30cba6ac61b2a1575273b9a998c372369698c21a8e518a39618", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525db